      "name": "oneThird",
      "root": {
        "id": 1,
        "name": "page",
        "kind": "column",
        "children": [
          {
            "id": 2,
            "name": "title",
            "kind": "prop",
            "prop": "text",
            "with": {
              "text": {
                "en": "Going back: which p/q is x = 0.333…? Multiply by 10 and every digit slides one place left. Look at the digits after the point (the tail): they match. Tap − to subtract x from 10x.",
                "hi": "उल्टा चलें: x = 0.333… कौन-सा p/q है? 10 से गुणा करो तो हर अंक एक जगह बाएँ खिसक जाता है। दशमलव के बाद वाले अंकों की कतार (पूँछ) देखो: दोनों एक जैसी हैं। 10x में से x घटाने के लिए − दबाओ।"
              },
              "style": "title",
              "speak": {
                "en": "Going back: which p over q is x equals 0.333 and so on? Multiply by 10 and every digit slides one place left. Look at the digits after the point, the tail: they match. Tap minus to subtract x from 10 x.",
                "hi": "उल्टा चलें: x बराबर 0.333 और आगे, यह कौन-सा p बटा q है? 10 से गुणा करो तो हर अंक एक जगह बाएँ खिसक जाता है। दशमलव के बाद वाले अंकों की कतार, यानी पूँछ, देखो: दोनों एक जैसी हैं। 10 x में से x घटाने के लिए माइनस दबाओ।"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 3,
            "name": "tapes",
            "kind": "prop",
            "prop": "decimalShift",
            "with": {
              "whole": 0,
              "prefix": "",
              "block": "3",
              "topPower": 1,
              "bottomPower": 0,
              "showResult": true
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 4,
            "name": "mayaCancel",
            "kind": "prop",
            "isHidden": true,
            "prop": "line",
            "with": {
              "character": "maya",
              "line": {
                "en": "The tails were identical, digit for digit, so they cancelled exactly: 9x = 3, so x = 3/9 = 1/3.",
                "hi": "पूँछें अंक-दर-अंक एक जैसी थीं, इसलिए पूरी कट गईं: 9x = 3, तो x = 3/9 = 1/3।"
              },
              "speak": {
                "en": "The tails were identical, digit for digit, so they cancelled exactly: 9 x is 3, so x is 3 ninths, which is 1 third.",
                "hi": "पूँछें अंक-दर-अंक एक जैसी थीं, इसलिए पूरी कट गईं: 9 x बराबर 3, तो x बराबर 3 बटा 9, यानी 1 बटा 3।"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 5,
            "name": "rest",
            "kind": "space"
          }
